[
    {
        "id": "node-readme",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "flow-events",
        "name": "📖 README — SmartLab Node-RED Dashboard",
        "info": "# SmartLab Asset Borrowing — Node-RED Monitoring Dashboard\n\n## Versi\n- Node-RED: 5.0.0\n- Dashboard: @flowfuse/node-red-dashboard v1.30.2 (Dashboard 2.0)\n\n## Flows\n1. **MQTT Event Monitor** — Subscribe smartlab/events, tampilkan BORROW_CREATED & RETURN_CONFIRMED\n2. **Heartbeat & Device Status** — Subscribe smartlab/heartbeat, monitor ESP32-S3 online/offline\n3. **Stats Polling** — Poll GET /api/stats/overview setiap 10 detik, tampilkan gauge & text\n4. **Activity Feed** — Poll GET /api/stats/activity?limit=10 setiap 15 detik, tampilkan tabel\n5. **Manual Admin Actions** — Tombol Refresh Stats untuk trigger manual\n\n## Setup\n1. Pastikan MQTT broker berjalan di localhost:1883\n2. Pastikan backend API berjalan di http://127.0.0.1:3001\n3. Ganti `ADMIN_TOKEN` pada node 'Set Auth Header' dengan JWT token admin yang valid\n4. Import file ini ke Node-RED via menu → Import → Clipboard\n5. Deploy dan buka Dashboard di http://localhost:1880/dashboard",
        "x": 280,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },

